{"id": "EUVD-2026-108336", "enisaUuid": "4d5db122-2db1-3fb9-92e0-d179978d0c05", "description": "CFITSIO through 4.7.0 contains an out-of-bounds write vulnerability in ffgcls2() in getcols.c that trusts attacker-controlled heap descriptor lengths for variable-length string columns. Attackers can supply a crafted FITS file that overflows a fixed 28,800-byte stack buffer and the caller's string array, enabling arbitrary code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:14:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:14:04", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://gist.github.com/yure1432/98f15c7e8f48dc90ae65646f926aa176", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/pull/184", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/commit/579792e0f85bff0c6733ad5ebdf54c3b5c188686", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cfitsio-through-4.7.0-out-of-bounds-write-via-ffgcls2-in-getcols-c"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115504", "GHSA-wjcj-f49x-x56c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1ea6ae96-392f-3ab0-905f-2790d9bfbe14", "product": {"name": "CFITSIO", "vendor": {"name": "NASA"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "beb1501c-0a23-3b01-8556-d83ba47f751a", "vendor": {"name": "HEASARC"}}], "isExploited": false}